WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
VICTOR DAVIS HANSON: It's
not hysterical to say

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:06.540
that the COVID-19 quarantine and
mass national lockdown, which

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.850
we've never seen
in American history

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:13.630
despite our long
experience with plague,

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:17.650
encouraged the destruction of
the middle class in general

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.500
and the middle class business
person in particular.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.130
And it championed or
enhanced or empowered

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.410
large corporations
that were vertically

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:30.100
integrated-- the Amazons,
the Targets, the social media

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.170
companies, the Zooms.

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:34.070
Now, how did that happen?

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:35.350
Well, think for a minute.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:39.160
If you sold shoes, and
you were a small business,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.660
you were shut down.

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:44.290
If you sold flowers,
you were shut down.

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:48.060
If you had a small restaurant,
you were shut down.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.530
If you had a small business
that repaired watches,

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:53.820
you were shut down.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.580
If you sold phones, you
were often shut down.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.530
And yet, you could
go into Walmart.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:00:59.790
You could go into Target.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:02.340
You could get something
to eat, fast food.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.307
You could buy shoes.

00:01:03.307 --> 00:01:04.140
You could buy socks.

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:05.410
You could buy anything.

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:08.340
And when you went into Walmart,
or you went into Target,

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.500
or you went into any
of these large chain

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.730
stores, what did you see?

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:15.570
You saw hundreds of
people congested in there.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.430
It was very different
than the experience

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:20.048
of going in and opening a
door, the little bell rang.

00:01:20.048 --> 00:01:21.840
There might have been
one or two customers.

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:23.850
You knew the small
business person.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.350
You could say, to the small,
have you been vaccinated?

00:01:26.350 --> 00:01:27.540
Have you had COVID?

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.760
All of that interpersonal
relationship

00:01:29.760 --> 00:01:32.430
that's so innate to
small communities

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:34.380
and small businesses.

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:38.670
But whether by intent or
just accidentally or laxity,

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:44.400
we essentially said to the small
business person, you obey us,

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.320
and you're going to
shut down your business,

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:48.180
and you have no power to object.

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:49.350
You have no capital.

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:51.180
You have no vertical
integration.

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:52.630
You have no influence.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:56.750
And then we said to
the large corporation,

00:01:56.750 --> 00:02:00.132
people during this lockdown
will still need to have shoes.

00:02:00.132 --> 00:02:01.340
They'll need to buy clothing.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:02.600
They'll be need to buy food.

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:05.960
They'll need to buy durable
goods and appliances.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:10.340
And we pick, we select you
to be the conveyor of that,

00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:12.590
and you're exempt
from the lockdown

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:15.380
because we trust that you're
large, and you're efficient,

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.860
and you're wealthy, and we've
dealt with you in the past

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:22.400
through political PACs and
donations and influence.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:25.280
And so it doesn't
take a conspiracy

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.650
to see empirically
that the middle class

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:29.540
and the middle
class businessperson

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:33.650
suffered enormously under COVID
lockdowns and quarantines.

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:37.550
And large corporations got
larger and more powerful

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:38.600
and more dangerous.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:41.950
[MUSIC PLAYING]

